#: diana_diary/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "DIARY"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/3
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Hang on! My Content Aware is going off!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/11
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Diana, your diary, experiences some mental health concerns that might be too much for some players. Including things like hallucinations, paranoia, extreme mood swings, loss of sense of self, and executive dysfunction."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/19
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You cool with that? Or you want to skip it?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's skip it please!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm okay with this type of stuff."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "No worries - hey, Diana!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "How would you like your relationship with Diana to resolve?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friendship!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hate!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Diana is elated to find that you love her as much as she believes she does!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/c-0/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It's love!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/c-0/35 diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/c-1/35 diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/c-2/35
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "See you out there on the next one!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Diana's pages whirl in a torrent of friendship!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/c-1/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Aww... friends forever."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "On the last of Diana's pages - a new entry: enemies."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/c-2/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Enjoy your... hateship."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-0/35/c-2/68 diana_diary/diana_ending_hate/82
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "We can close the book on this side of your past."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/skylar_diana_content/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Carry on, then!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A strange figure stands before you, a whirlwind of conflicting energies and vibes. Manic and dignified, friendly and intimidating—she's dressed like some sort of quasi-Victorian text-themed aristocrat."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You couldn't have imagined what the dateviators might make of your thoughts transcribed on paper, but if you could it likely would not have been this."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you approach her she launches right into what feels like the middle of a one-sided conversation."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/30
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey there, new friend!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ask what? I haven't asked anything. Haven't SAID anything."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good point."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Aaaahhhhh!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But the blue one. The blue one, and then the butterfly. Why is there so much sand?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Why is there always sand in places where sand should never be??"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Excuse me?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have no idea what you want from me..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are so weird, and I'm totally into it!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, I really don't need this craziness right now."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "The sand on the beach was stuck under my nails... but I've never been to, I've never been..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Have I been to a beach? Why would I have been to a beach, why can't I remember?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You might have been to a beach, I'm not sure."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think it's normal for people to forget things."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "None of it's normal! If everything is normal nothing is normal, and why won't you tell me?! NOW you keep a secret!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Funny timing, band leader... it's a bad bad rhythm you're leading."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Too much percussion. Far too much booming and banging around in here!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't mean anything bad, whatever I said!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're not making any sense..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh nobody ever MEANS it. Nobody ever means ANYTHING!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/g-0/16/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's the problem. Pushing the button, I didn't mean it. Smiling at the man across the room and when he comes over with a laced drink in his hand I didn't mean it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/g-0/16/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's mean, it's mean to not mean what you mean... and a side of applesauce, please..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/g-0/16/c-0/34 diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/g-0/16/c-1/34 diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-0/66 diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/39/c-1/34 diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/39/c-2/18 diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/55/c-0/18 diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-1/50 diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-2/43 diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/g-0/24/g-0/43 diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-0/39/g-0/24 diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-1/23 diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-0/39/c-1/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And with that, she is gone."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Sense, cents, scents haven't you noticed?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/g-0/16/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Nevermind. At this point, since I've made my point, it doesn't matter."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-3/23/g-0/16/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Come back for the county fair, if you want a real point. The illusionist has a cane!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What does anyone want?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I wanted a pair of shoes once, it was such a beautiful pair, the color,"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It was molten. I could feel them melting right through the shop window!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I never went back."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Aren't you afraid of getting burned?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, actually. I hate fire."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drowning is what gets me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "NO I've never been fired! How dare you, who gave you the right, how could you know that??"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Take your magic away from me... take these words with you. Could you? Can you do that?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "TAKE YOUR DAMN HANDS OFF THEM, they're mine. They're mine. What else would you have me have, me have, me have... oops, I got lost!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Sometimes the road less travelled is less travelled for a reason."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-0/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "They won't build a gas station if there's an ogre down the way!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-0/47
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "God, to drown, just to drown and dissolve and the ink swirls around me in the water like a shroud..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-0/55
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I've been drowning forever."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Wouldn't YOU love to know."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Wouldn't your little heart just burst if you thought you could fill it all the way up..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "...and that would take away the loneliness and make you less confused, more like you belonged somewhere."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Have you ever belonged? Belonged, anywhere, really? There was an ice cream parlor once where I thought I'd be happy to die as a piece of cookie dough in a deep freeze."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't do this right now. Good luck."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like cookie dough. I could die as cookie dough."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/39/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why am I hungry?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/39/c-0/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It is far too difficult to make sense of what your diary is saying, and you take your leave."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Then go. Go and get some."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Hot pizza apple pie, the American Nightmare!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Come back and tell me all about it for 15 cents a copy!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-4/47/c-1/39/c-2/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Because the dragon told you to be..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Into it, out of it, it's all the same."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Into one thing is out of another and on and on until you're dizzy and there's nobody to catch you because the basketball game started late."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oof, yeah. Sports. They suck."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd catch you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Suck?! SUCK?! Oh come on, have you ever actually thought about a straw?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I had to use one once after they took those teeth away..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "No, no no... that's... that's not right, I... I wanted to. I wanted to but they told me I would bleed if I did, bleed and die and have to go back so they could take more from me, take more because I had more to lose."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But it wasn't me! I counted my teeth. I counted my teeth and they're all there."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Thoughts on the other hand... somehow I have too many of those."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/47
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "INVENTORY IS OFF, PEOPLE! START THE COUNT AGAIN!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, I'm losing you a little here..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wisdom teeth! Yeah! They said that to me, too, kind of."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/55/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's alright. Haven't I lost you somewhere before?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/55/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Wisdom. What an overrated quality."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/55/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Quali-tea, boil me up. Quali-tee, but it's cheap and ill-fitting and you're gonna throw it out in a month."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/55/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's ok to stare at my chest if I'm making a point!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/55/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "A feminist point. Ha! The point of a nipple through the shirt but if I've noticed it, aren't I the bad guy? Even if I'm not a guy. I don't think."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/55/c-1/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm tired. I'm a tired feminist. Come back again when I've rested and grown my armor back."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-0/55/c-1/50 diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/47/g-0/56
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And with that, she's gone."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "aha. ahahahaha. AHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA! Ahhhh, my god."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I've been falling... I fall so much I can't even remember the last time I landed. It's all falling."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But you said, already, that you'd be there."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Wasn't that you? At the Italian place that Saturday in New York, wasn't that you? It should've been."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-5/23/c-1/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Tomatoes. Yes. Come back when you've had enough tomatoes."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-6/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ah but of course, that poor little pony could never make the jump."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-6/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What do you do with a drunken sailor but SHOOT HIM and pat yourself on the back for \"doing your duty.\""
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-6/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ponies?? How the hell did we get there?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-0/22/c-6/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shooting something is super traumatic actually, thanks."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Doesn't matter. None of it matters."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "The trick is to realize that it never did, and content yourself with the dark corners of the cave, staring at the reflected firelight and judging the world you'll never see."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ha. Funny. Fun, knee, thigh, thigh-slapper, slap, slit, flap, knit me back up like an old sweater."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. Ok. I... have to go."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Word play. This is fever dream stuff."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you even hear me?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-1/c-7/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It is too difficult to make sense out of your own diary, and you take your leave."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I swear to god I could hear a pin drop... does anyone have a pin?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So many things are happening all the time, it's like snow in the globe. It's dust floating through the burning light in the window."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So you closed the shades, but did you know the neigbors can still see? There's always someone watching,"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Did you know?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/openthebelljar/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Call me when you're in town again, we'll get tea and laugh at the peasants!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Diana is fully absorbed in her own endless monologue when you find her again."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Round and round the mulberry tree, round and round the mulberry tree..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I ate a mulberry once! Actually I had them dried, in a trail mix with cashews and some cousin to chocolate."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But then I bought the trail mix at a different store and I chomped down and there was glass in it. Glass falling out of my mouth!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Have you ever chewed on glass...?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Finally, her gaze darts over to you—it appears you've finally caught her notice."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/48
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh! Oh, there's a you there now. Oooh... Are you there? Is that you?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, hey. Little nervous to be back here, but I came."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's me. I missed your good gibberish!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh bummer. You're still like this, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You're nervous? Nerve, Us. Nerves is a part of Us, part of being an US."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Maybe it's me, maybe it's me that makes the US... I make you nerve-us."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Which I get. I'm a goddamned broken fire hydrant, you should be nervous!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Be careful, you're gonna get swept out to sea..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Think I'm probably ok, but thanks for checking in."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thing is, I think we actually have a lot in common."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's possible? There's enough crazy in this house, I'm out."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "No problem."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'll always check. I love checking things off. I never seem to be the one holding the pen, but I do feel it when things get checked off..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "scritch-SCRATCH and that's one more weight off my mind."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Wait. MY mind? Is it mine? I thought..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Huzzah! Really?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "God you poor animal."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You should run."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Did you know that all six wives of Henry the VIII thought they loved him in the beginning! ALL SIX!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-1/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You think one of them would've watched her sisters fall under the wheels of church, state, and ego and mad-dashed for a foreign court but NOOOOOOO."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-1/47
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You should've seen me coming. It has to be you who runs, I CAN'T MOVE. And what am I if not HERE, what am I if not blank, waiting, overflowing but never fucking full enough."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-1/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I see what you're saying... but you're wrong."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-1/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can we just slow down for a minute?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-2/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Crazy? Who's CRAZY?! Oh yeah, just because she can't stop she must be crazy, right?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-2/18
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Just because she's never alone and she's always alone it must be her fault, right?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-2/26
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ahhhh god these contradictions are hurting my head... where is my head? I think I left it with my left foot somewhere on a dance floor..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-2/34
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'll bet you've never lost your head, huh? Can't bake a pie with a lost head."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-2/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What pie?? What the hell are you talking about??"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-2/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For god's sake, will you make sense?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-2/42/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Fie! Am I talking? I didn't mean to talk. I never mean to talk."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-2/42/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm not even the one talking, I'm just trying to get a breath. I can't breathe in here!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-2/42/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Have you ever gone scuba diving? I did once... It was so cold down there. They don't tell you how alone you'll feel..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-0/39/c-2/42/g-0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I have to go, there's a reason I have to go... can't I stay? Wouldn't even if I could. You're the one leaving, not me. Again. Right?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Good gibberish. Gibber jibber on the jib, where they hang people!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "'twas a good hanging."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Arr! You missed a good hanging, chum! The fella's feet twitched for a full turn o' the clock HA or I'm a blown fool!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See? That. Love that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sound like a pirate story I read once."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's my pleasure to bring a smile to your face."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "At least I think it is. Who cares in the end. Everything fades and changes."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Except for me! I don't get to change. I'm eternal."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And I'm not even a Me! I'm just a collection of words and mess swirling around..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I am lonely again."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/40
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I guess it's weird... weird you came back. If you're even really here which I still don't buy."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/48
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Do you really want more? Consider yourself warned."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I do. This all feels familiar somehow."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I still bail?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Familiar. Family-are. How could that be. That doesn't make sense at all."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Unless... are you made up of little pieces, too? Oh oh do they combine when you're not looking and then BAM suddenly there's a basilisk staring at you down the barrel of her jaw?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean... yeah. I am."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See... I wrote a story about a basilisk once. Why did you choose that?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You... huh. You're making me bounce on my feet, pal, jab jab cross, boy-o."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I get it. I'd use that image to describe being off balance."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're confused. I think I have an answer."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Well bring it on, Captain Bligh. Captain Blight, blithely unaware, his crew making their mutiny right under his sweaty nose."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You've seen that movie right?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep I have. You know it because I know it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I loved it. I wrote in my diary about it after."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm your diary."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you know that movie... because I do."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ha. Ah. Ahahahahahahahahah!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So THAT'S why you've come back! You're looking for that old feeling."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You're wanting to write something down, get it off your mind, promise yourself you're going to go back and read it one day and never do."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Is it because I'm not funny?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm definitely not funny. I've checked. People only laugh when they're walking away, putting me back on the shelf."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/40
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So they're not laughing with me. They're laughing at something they've taken with them when they leave. Something I'll never get back."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/48
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You put so much down."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/56
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You take so much when you go."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-0/23/g-0/8/g-0/16/g-0/8/g-0/64
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And I'm left with it all..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Bail. Bale! Hay bales! I hucked those once."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Those stupid pants were covered but that's what I get for being too much of a coward to wear jeans."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But yeah, get out."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Get out into the world, get up on that carousel and ride those ponies! Yeehaw!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-1/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I don't like carousels, I can't stand going around and round and round and round and round and round... stupid circles. I'm dizzy already."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-1/47
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "The music never stops."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-1/31/g-0/56/c-1/55
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Go riding, I'm sure I'll hear all about it one day when you \"have a minute\"... Navel gazing prick."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Hahahahaha. Ahahahahahahahahah"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "AHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!!!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Well-spotted, spotted dick!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-2/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You'll forgive me, of course, Mr. Carseat but I'm not inclined to dance just now."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/second_encounter/0/c-2/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Loop-dee-loops, 'round the mulberry tree, and we follow the piper to the end of the world!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm getting tired."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Do you ever have that, where you get so tired you think maybe soon you'll stop caring enough to keep your heart beating?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That one day, just a few moments from now, you'll watch as it slows and slows and stops and you won't mind?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Never mind. Don't worry. For some reason I always say things like that after I've said something true."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I really hated that teacher. He bumped into ME. He spilled my food all over ME and then yelled at me in front of everyone."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/40
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I've never felt as quiet as I did in that moment, in that linoleum lunchroom, embedded with the scent of turkey tetrazzini."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But that's MY story. That happened to me in high school."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was awful. I remember writing about that the night it happened."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For the first time since you met her, Diana's manic energy quiets just a moment."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "...you wrote about it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You wrote about it after it happened to you... in high school."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You were in the lunchroom, too? In the basement?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/my_mind/0/g-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. I wrote about it in you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/6
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You did..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/14
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You did... this to me?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/25
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You put that in me... you put that story, that memory... wait, I'm NOT that story. That story has been eating away at me, you know. Like bleaching coral."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/33
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Why did you. Why would you. Because I am not you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because you were so good at keeping secrets."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I needed a friend."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I was that. I am that. I should be that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Shouldn't a diary be the safest place? Safe. Like a fortress with a great moat. Safe. Keeping everyone out. So nobody can hear my screams from the inside."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm shouting, I'm bleeding, I'm leaking and I don't recognize what should be my own blood..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Yes, tell me, tell me. Oh, I feel like I'm nothing if you don't tell me. And then I'm nothing when you do because I don't get to keep any of it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But I'd never tell. I promise, I promise I'd never mean to."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know that. But you might anyway?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you saying you'd talk about what I wrote in you?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Of course I would. My god."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I would try to dam up my mouth but my apologies for talking would come right out with the rest of it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But I'd be so sorry... I am so sorry. Doesn't that count?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really. If I can't trust you, that's a problem."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure it does. I can tell you're trying."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But it's not me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Don't you get it? It isn't me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You just said so!!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "There was a great green bug, and he split himself open trying to live and he died and then something else got born but I can't remember..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What the hell are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "YOU TELL ME! You TELL me! And tell me quickly before it doesn't matter anymore. Soon I won't care."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's already slipping away from me... soon it won't even matter that I can feel it, I can feel that the secrets aren't mine."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You trusted me once. I know you did. I have it all here, I have it written down."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was before. I haven't written in a diary for a long time now."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Don't I know it! I don't know what's heavier, what I don't know or what I do know. About you? About me? How many other voices?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "How many of us would there be if you added all the voices together?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Can you hear the dark chorus? Aren't they deafening? Why don't you double over with your fists over your ears, why aren't you screaming?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "How can you not be screaming?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe I'm just better now! Maybe I don't need you anymore."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Maybe not. And maybe you do. I can't tell. I can never really tell."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But I won't stay where I'm not wanted. I'll leave. I swear, I will, watch me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I don't really want to but I will... don't you want me to leave? I'll do it if you ask me to... you might have to tell me to though, and do it loudly before someone else starts up."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you could just be, I don't know, less... weird?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "WEIRD! I LOVE that word. Wyrd, weerd..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Of course it's not. You just meant I'm weird, right? Freakish, uncomfortable, odd, bizarre, off-kilter, SCARY, UNNERVING, WRONG, right?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Well. Shows what YOU know, Wrongright."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-4/39/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/31/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Goodnight, moon, don't let the bedbugs eat you alive..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm not trying. If I was really trying I wouldn't be this way. If I had willpower, if I really cared, wouldn't I be better?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It must be my fault. It must be me, being screwed up... there's nobody else HERE."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-5/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "There's nobody... it's just me. It has to be me. I should be better."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-5/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You should go. Or I should go. One of us should, and hurry. Once you're at the bottom of the rabbithole, the lights just get dimmer and then they die..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-5/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's ok, I've been down before, too. I'm not scared."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-5/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Of course you've been down. Where do you think I learned how to do it?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-5/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You should be scared. I'm scared. Let's be scared."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/didthistome/0/g-1/c-5/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Quickly quickly, the wind is picking up now..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's you!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And I know it's you because it's not ME, because I am ME and you are YOU and we're different. I'm your diary."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/22
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm holding all the stories."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/30
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Dear god you have a lot of stories; and it's all so damned sad."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/38
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "No wonder I feel this way all the time."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/46
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You only come to me when you have something horrible that you can't hold all by yourself."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/54
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's something painful and weird and full of spikes and when you've had enough of it you just close me and walk away."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/62
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What have they said about love being blind? I think maybe her scales are snake's scales, that circuitous, sneak-thieving bitch."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/70/s/0 diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And hi to you, too."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/71/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your mind is amazing."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. Um, maybe I should come back later..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Hi high, way up in the crow's nest and from there don't we all look small."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I've been thinking about what you did to me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What you do to me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "The dumping, the writing, the leaving me?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Burdened and open to the world! No safety, no gratitude, and for fuck's sake, so few happy stories!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm alone with it, with monsters and gnashing teeth and the things you'd never even tell to a friend..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Because friends might look back at you and wouldn't that be awful."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on now, you know I didn't mean to hurt you!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "God, I... I never even thought about it like that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Of course you didn't!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "There's never any reason to think about any of it, until whoever is listening finally throws up their hands and says enough."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's inertia. It makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Do you know I've never even asked the question, who am I? I've been so stuffed with your overripe stories that there hasn't even been space to wonder what else might be in here?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I've just been YOURS. That's been it, and all of it. God, can you even imagine how SUFFOCATING that feels?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you're being a little dramatic."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I... I'm really sorry. I don't know how I can make this better."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh you haven't SEEN me do dramatic."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Come on. You know what YOU'RE capable of."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Do you really think I've even started down that road yet? This is entry level. The appetizer."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "This is foreplay, motherfucker."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok. I'm gonna go. I'll come back later."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're hot when you're mad."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You do that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'll be here."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Where else could I go..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Careful. Don't get a diary too hot. I know where all your lit matches are..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well then light me up."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's go, kindling. I'll be your big log."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I do have one brand new thing I can do."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "All the thinking I've been doing, realizing all this about what I am, what you are... I've learned a few things."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'll bet you want to see it, don't you? A brand new trick from someone who knows you better than anyone else in the world? Better than you know yourself, even?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yeah I do."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ready!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/g-0/24/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I've learned..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/g-0/24/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "To be silent."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/g-0/24/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "There's so much. Too much I don't know. Can't control. But I've learned how, at long last, to stop talking. To say nothing."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/g-0/24/g-0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So my new trick... is leaving you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-0/39/c-1/15/g-0/24/g-0/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "How does that feel."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Neither do I."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Maybe you can't. It's not even my job to know those things, why am I trying to give you an answer?!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "God, even this! Just let it suck, maybe, just hear me maybe! I don't know. Some things don't get better. Some things can't ever be better."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Please go. If you're just going to sit there... and there's that look, that pitying confusion."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-1/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That look is acid on me, I'd use my own blood to dilute that look if I thought it would help. It won't."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/39/g-0/40/c-1/47
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Dry. Dry as a bone, dry as a page... GET IT?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Don't you mean YOUR mind? I've never had one of my own. I've just been a proxy. I'm an appendage! I'm a prop!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You take, but you take by giving, and you don't give by taking any of it back. Or by taking responsibility. Or even by writing down the things that were beautiful or soft or sweet."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Those you keep in your head and you siphon off all the shit and the loss and the seething resentments until I'm drowning in you!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What if I wasn't just you? What if I AM, on my own? What if I could watch a sunrise and think not about the people who will never be able to watch it with me, but about how pretty it is?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Maybe I can."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we could try together."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love how you describe experiences."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "NO! Don't you get it??"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's always \"together.\" I've been a conjoined twin my whole fucking life only I didn't know it, none of my experiences were mine because they weren't even ours, they were yours. They can't be ours if I'M not even there!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Just go. Just leave."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You're always there. Don't you see?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-0/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Always and never. Always for you and never for me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-0/47
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I think I would die if you stayed away. But if you don't go away right now, I'll combust. WHOOSH."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-0/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok... I'm... I'll see you later."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-0/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't get it. I'm lost. But, whatever. I can go."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-0/55/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With a look back at her to make sure she doesn't combust, you take your leave."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's right. Butter me up."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But why? There's nothing more I can do for you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "There's nothing more I can give to you than I've already given, what the hell more could you possibly ask for?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Glutton for service, glutton for presence, glutton for availability without payment or consequence. I think I'm gonna be sick."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm being honest. I think you're really interesting and cool."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe I'm not helping right now. I'll see you later."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh. I..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Y'know what, no. No. NO."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Cool like a cucumber. Cool like an ice cream cone. Cool Hand Lemonade and I'm none of it. I want none of it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "If I'm cool, then leave me to the glacial pace of my own thoughts for now. The glaciers are melting, right? Dripping away into a reservoir that might be poisoned? Sounds right."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok. I'll... talk to you later, then."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like you. I'll just keep saying it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-0/39/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Yeah, that works."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-0/39/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Thanks, pal, all the switches seem to be operating now."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-0/39/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Just don't hit the red button... Ah, too late. Don't worry. I didn't like that city much anyway."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Or will you? By the time you get back the park will have closed, the swings will still be moving but only because the ghost children can finally come out to play."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-1/47/c-1/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Whatever. Goodnight. Even the racoons are over it now."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Maybe indeed! Maybe \"later\" things will be different, and we can gloss over THIS moment right now and pretend that everything was always ok. Right?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But was it ever ok."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I don't know the answer to this. I'm asking. I don't know anyone else to ask. I don't know anyone else."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Do you get that? Did you hear me? You're it. You've been it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And now you're leaving. Again. Right? You are? Are you?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, yeah, you obviously don't want me here right now."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not going to stay and get yelled at, that's for damn sure."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/47/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh god. Don't. Please don't."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/47/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What will I do if you leave? Because I never know when you'll come back, if you'll come back."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/47/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I don't even know how to sense the passage of time, I can't mark days without your pen, I can't notice sunsets and changes in the moon without your eyes. You leave and it's nothing."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/47/g-0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And what's worse. Nothing? Or the overwhelm?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/47/g-0/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I can't think. I've never tried to do it for myself before and it hurts."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/47/g-0/40
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Do what you want. Do what you have to. You always do. I guess that's normal."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/third_encounter/0/c-2/47/g-0/48
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And what the hell are you doing here if you're NORMAL. Normal for now. Eventually the wheel will turn back around to that little pebble in the tread and you'll remember me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Hi."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's it? Just hi?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Does that mean you're sorry for losing it last time?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Just hi. That's it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's all I have."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Funny, so steeped in words words words I could make a metropolis if I ever needed one and now all I have is hi."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I might be owed more than that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's ok. Hi is enough for now. How are you doing?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Owed. Owed a payment. Like a seesaw going back and forth, in debt, making debt. Aren't you tired?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm tired. I find I almost miss my flow of words. You know, I feel a lonely I didn't know about before. My kind. Not just the lack of your pen on the page but... the lack of my own ink to fill the space."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really yelled at me before."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh. I think I get that. Lonely for yourself."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I did. I did. I kid."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "A rare kind of loneliness."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/g-0/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I might have an idea..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I... am doing. I look at things. I think. I feel sad. I feel happy or I feel confused. Who is doing the feeling? It isn't you. You aren't there."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But I don't have words for it now. I find that I miss them. I miss the words. Your words. Even if I wasn't in control of them... at least they were there."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Wouldn't I rather an untamed herd of horses than an empty paddock, blowing dust, and nothing grows."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if we put those words into action?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Those words were all yours. And they were beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What good is a diary with no words."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "At best I'm a scrapbook. Ransom notes of cutout letters, glaring out from behind a semi-gloss wall with mismatched eyes."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/31/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have an idea..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/31/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have words. I wouldn't ever have said that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/31/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So once again, I'll be led. Is this another \"just in case\" where you take me somewhere only to leave me in the bag, scribbling down a few notes to make it feel like you didn't waste the weight in bringing me?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/31/g-0/16/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'd rather stay here if it's that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/31/g-0/16/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm tired."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/31/g-0/16/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not that. I'm going to set you free."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/31/c-1/31/g-0/16/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I get it. Trust me, this'll be worth it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I have to say something but it means that I had to feel it fully and I gotta tell ya it sucks somethin' awful."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I was on the bottom of the ocean for a little while and the water was filling my lungs and the salt was burning me and leaking out of my eyes with it all."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're sorry? What for?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, too."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "For yelling. For losing my temper."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I AM AND I'M NOT! Part of me knows that it was a GRAND thing I did. And part of me shivers to think I did that to you, my only friend, my only... my person."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/26
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "All my memories, my stories... all my words came from you. How dare I throw them back at you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/34
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And also WHAT RIGHT did you have. What right do you have? This kept-ness, like I'm some exotic stuffed parrot gathering dust."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/42
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Only I'm not a stuffed parrot. I'm ME. I'm a ME now. And I know it wasn't right. It isn't right."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/50
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm sorry that I'm not sorry that I'm sorry... I could get carried away here..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/58/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, don't. It's ok. I haven't appreciated you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/58/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How'd you like to really be your own person?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/58/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Nobody does. I haven't asked."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/58/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I didn't know I could."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/58/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I guess you do have to be taught that you can."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/58/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm asking now. I'm demanding now. Is it right to demand a right? Am I doing this right?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/58/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think we can fix that!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-0/58/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It is right. And I want to help you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "...you are?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-1/18
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I... I think all the fireworks just went off at once, don't let the wizard see you!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-1/26
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What are you sorry for?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I took you for granted."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't call. I didn't write."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Yes. Yes that's... that's it. That's all."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I would give anything right now for a torrent of words, of my own best words."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But they're all yours."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/g-0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And I can't give you back your words. That's regifting. Awful to throw your thoughts back at you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/g-0/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "The thought of it is making me feel sick... but if I threw up, even that would be yours. SoCo and lime from that beach in San Diego..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/g-0/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have an idea about how to give you your own words."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/g-0/40/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was a bad night. For me, though. Not for you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And just when I thought the little rats were done scratching. I thought this could be clear. Clean."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That maybe I could apologize and you would, too, because we both made mistakes."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And there you are shoveling blame onto me like so much coal on a fire that's already raging."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I was sorry. I was. Until you demanded that I be."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Whatever I lost, you had already taken."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/47
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Isn't it sad? To find that I am a ME, to learn what that ME is through learning only that I do not want ME to be like you?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow that's harsh."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look, I... I am sorry. Can we start over?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Winters usually are."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Nothing blooms. The world is in hiding."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Maybe you deserve a good cold season."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Nevermind. No more of your words. I have enough of your voices screaming. With anymore doubt and confusion, I might come apart at the seams."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I cannot deal with you anymore."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we'll have a spring sometime."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-0/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'd like that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-0/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It was never my job to control the seasons. And if it was, I've already failed."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-0/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I keep trying to make the rains come and they won't. Or they come out of your eyes. Which seems... inefficient."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-0/39/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Look for me again when the crocus buds."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Of course we can. Turn the page. Scratch at me with that stupid eraser that hasn't worked since sophomore year... honestly, why won't you just throw that pencil away?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Going to assume that's a yes..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry if I hurt you with my writing implements."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Yes. Yes yes. Your idea."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/55/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "All's well that ends well."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ok. Tell me. You have told me a lot so another idea, another thought... I think I can hold it if I've held all the others."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I feel like a cartoon character. Is this what a cartoon character feels like? I've never been one, so I don't know. You've never been one. Or even seen one. At least you've never written a story about it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have definitely seen at least one cartoon."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I must have told you a lot of others, though. Which one would you like to hear?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And not written about it? What a racket."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Gosh I wonder... you do so much telling. I wonder if I could tell, this time?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Too many to choose from! That's like saying pick a star in the sky but just one? The others might get jealous and gang up on me!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I could do it. Of course I could, it's just an action. Any action is possible with the right motivation."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It was either a life coach or a sociopath who said that I think. What's the difference, if you really break it down."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Why am I doing this?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because we're going to use it to separate you from me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll own it, and then you won't have to anymore."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Gasp. I..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's possible? We can do that?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So I'll pick one, and then what? I'll tell it to you and you'll wave the wand and swirl the cape..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And I'll be... better. Me. Whole. Alone but not alone, on my own in the good way?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ok ok, pick one."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-1/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me the prettiest story."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-1/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The most interesting story, please."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-1/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The most available story."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Hm. Which is the most pretty... no, that's never a good metric."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "The most interesting! No, good god I'd be here all day figuring that one out."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "The most available. Yes. Yes. The one right here right now, the one saying TELL ME! I'll tell you the TELL ME stories."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "...I have one."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I have three!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "The one of the man who had a seizure."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "The one about waiting in the wings of Edinburgh."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ooh! ...crashing into a tree, on skis, tree-ski meltdown."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You'd better pick one before they overwhelm me... once I open this thoroughfare all the bones want out..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-2/48/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The seizure one. I love medical stuff."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-2/48/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Edinburgh, Scotland?? Cool!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-2/48/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "TreeSki meltdown, for sure."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part2/0/g-2/48/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There aren't any left..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/outofpages/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But these are all the pages I can find at this time."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/outofpages/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Do come again, shall you?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/4
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh man. Ok. Keys in, brake off, seatbelt on, whuff."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/12
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I boarded the plane. I remember I was swinging. I thought I was going to be sick but I didn't stop moving."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/20
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Can't ever stop moving. And then sometimes I can't start, no matter how much I want to."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/28
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I can't remember walking down the jet bridge but I must've because otherwise how the hell does one fly."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/36
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I don't know much but I know I'm not a bird."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/44
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh god, am I a bird?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are not a bird."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't remember doing it, because I did it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Phew."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "If I'm... so you did it and I'm not a bird but I was there... where was I?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You were in my backpack."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was holding you in my hands, with my latte."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You were carrying me. Is that why I remember swinging? I was swinging... and YOU were walking."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes! You've got this!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's right. Keep going."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So I was on the plane then. Was I?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep, you were in my bag, under the seat."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Which is why it was dark. Dark and cold, which it shouldn't be on a plane unless you're flying at night and you have a blanket."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "...which I didn't. Because I'm a book. HA! I'm a book, so do I always have a jacket??"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-1/c-4/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, you're a journal so I guess you always have a cover."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-1/c-4/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha! You're making jokes... that's new!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's amazing! I... I never have to be cold again."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "YOU can be cold because maybe you're a doofus and forgot your coat but I'm ME and I always have a cover!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-2/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Doofus. That's... been a while since I got called that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-2/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nice to see your sense of humor is coming back!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I was writing in you, remember? I think I was writing about high school."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-2/c-5/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You were writing... that's where the pressure came from! And the buzzing and the bells in my head, it was from what you were writing."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-2/c-5/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I was absorbing a whole new memory from you, it was overwhelming... was it about a play you were in?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-2/c-5/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I remember all this makeup that you thought made you look old but it just made you look like you'd gone haywire with an eyebrow pencil..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-2/c-5/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haha. Yup. That was it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/theseizureone/0/g-2/c-5/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "YOU remember. See? YOU do. It's working! Keep going!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It was only a couple of minutes into the flight and I remember the seat in front of me suddenly going rigid and slamming itself back."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/11
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "There was an unearthly sound, a violent pulling of air through a narrow space."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/19
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It made this high, double-toned wheezing and red panic flooded through the whole cabin... radiating out of that seat."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/27
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That was the seizure. It must've been."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/35
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But I felt nothing. Nothing changed, not the light, not the sounds in my head. I heard it and I didn't hear it. I saw the panic but I didn't feel it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't write what I felt, only that it happened."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing changed for you. Only for me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So... I know that it happened because you told me after."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But I felt nothing because you didn't write about it... and it didn't happen to me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Does that make me cruel? Does that make me insensitive? That this man's life changed, everyone around me felt something and I... just watched?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No. You weren't YOU yet. I didn't tell you what to feel, so you couldn't."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not at all. Do you feel anything now?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I do feel it now. I feel fear for him, I feel curiosity about what happened, what made his body do that... you told me that when he came to he couldn't remember that it had happened, is that true?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. No memory of the past 30 minutes at all."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He was out, and then he was back. Like a light switch."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I might enjoy that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And I wonder, if I ever see anything like that again, will I have a reaction of my own, that's not just yours in ink?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I think I will."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "My god. I think I will."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Was he ok?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. They got him to a doctor."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope so."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Marvelous things, those."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I do to."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I wonder had you asked yourself if he was ok, or is that something I did? Or maybe we both did?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Wait! What if... what if instead of just telling me things, instead of me just holding secrets them kind of destroying me..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Look at how leaky and frightened and angry I was..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What if we could share them? What if... what if I had some, and you had some, and we were BOTH safe?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I would love that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh... kinda like that I'm the only one with opinions around here."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh man. Another personality I have to deal with... I don't think so."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Gimme... gimme a minute..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I think I can do this. I think I can really do this!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I think you've saved my life. I won't say you gave it to me because, well let's face it, that would make you god."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Wait. Are you god? Tell me now, because I'm in the rapid-fire process of creating my own cosmogony and if you're god, I definitely need to know."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haha. Nope. Not god."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well hold on now..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh good. God. Good god. Which isn't you!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's a load off."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Depart and return. I've got some figuring to do and... I can do it alone! I'll share it with you when it's baked! Do you like pie? I LOVE pie. Rhubarb!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-0/31/0/s/0 diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-6/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I read another memory?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you, Miss Rhubarb."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Select."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Plumb pudding."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You are. Aren't you. Of course you are! You're the creator, you created me, so even if you're not THE god, you may certainly be mine!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I guess I'm going to have to have a pantheon, then."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's a lot of naming. Good thing I've got so many words to choose from!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait. No, I'm not god. Not really."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes... yes it is. I shall return and I expect a pantheon in my honor at that time!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh I get it. It was fun to pretend?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Fun to see if you could pull the wool? A little joke-er-riino at my expense?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/31/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Don't worry about it, I'll get over it. BECAUSE I CAN DO THAT NOW. HEY!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/31/c-0/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Now SHOO. Even if I'm not building a pantheon I've got work to do. Work to share when it's ripe but not yet."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/31/c-0/47
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "This avocado is still hard as a brick so go away so I can wrap it in a paper bag and wait for it to boil."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Wow. I... I know god."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/31/c-1/18
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I just got born into consciousness of my consciousness, sapience of my sentience and I'm already on a first-ink basis with god."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-6/39/c-1/31/c-1/26
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "How FREAKING cool is that??"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh you do, do you?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You do."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Huh. For a moment there I was the Acheron, bluff above the water and sharp below, so fast."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And now... I dunno, damned dinghy, just bobbing."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I think I could sink. I could just sink right now and stare up at the sky from under the water, buried and floating at the same time."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. No hard feelings but... I'd rather be the one who has something to say."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, don't sink. I'll... I can get used to it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/47/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Of course of course."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/47/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So close and yet so far. To come so far and realize that closeness is just closed-ness with a little bitterness mixed in."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/47/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'll go now, shall I? Or shall I? Shall I stay? You say. You always say."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/47/c-0/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "On second thought, I'll go back into the dark. It's too bright out here in all the consciousness I can't keep."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/47/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You will. You will, I promise. You get used to it. Ever watched someone use a bicycle for the first time? Drunken monkey."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/47/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Let's be drunken monkeys. We can be scared and confused together. It'll be fun!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/47/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Like a roller coaster, fun and scary. I've been a coaster before. Not rolling, but we can work it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/47/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Give me a minute, ok? But come back. And if... when you do..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/seizure/0/g-2/c-7/47/c-1/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Maybe we'll both be used to using our selves this way."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/4
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It was a play. I was in a play. But I only remember one scene of it. It must've been longer than that, though; most plays are. Right?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I know what you're talking about but keep going."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Most are. Some are really small, though. Different strokes."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It was something magical. Everyone was speaking English but it sounded... different, like poetry or like a song with no music."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "There were fairies and talking animals and so many of the things I could see were sparkly, like things were just dusted over with this very fine layer of glitter."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I don't like glitter very much."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And glitter is so beautiful and celebratory and ethereal, I love glitter!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, hang on. This is Midsummer Night's Dream."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love this memory. Keep going."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Of course you know it, it's YOURS!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "The point here wasn't so that you could bathe in the reflected glory of this gorgeous memory, don't you do that enough with me??"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Help me! You said this would help me not be YOU anymore!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right! Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You only remember this scene because this is the moment I wrote about."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Much obliged."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I see I see I see..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I remember I was standing on my tiptoes in the wings, waiting for my entrance..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But when this moment was happening, you were on a desk. In the hotel."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You weren't in the wings, though. What do YOU remember?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I... Me. What do I remember. That isn't what you remember."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "This is archaeology. Like unearthing a minibus with toothbrushes."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's quiet."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "There's a single light on... just over my left shoulder. Can books have shoulders?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-3/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't see why not."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-3/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My memory is quiet, too. That's... keep going."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I can see the dust motes falling through the air. I can smell... something stale but not unpleasant. Old but well-cared for. Musty and comfortable."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh wow... I can remember my breathing."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Steady. Bated. Like I was waiting for something."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait... this is your memory, right?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's exactly what I was doing, waiting for my entrance."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-4/c-10/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's... difficult to tell..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I was waiting for you to come back."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "The light was on, I was open on the desk, imagining the adventure you must be having."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You'd told me so often how excited you were to be in Edinburgh, how much you loved this play, what a dream come true the whole experience was."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I was so happy for you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-5/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And here I thought... I guess I was wrong. This is SUCH a happy memory."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-5/40
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And I was waiting, patient and thrilling for you to come back. Come home. And tell me about it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-5/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's amazing. Different memories, but we were so in sync."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-5/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And I did. I came back and wrote about that moment."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I think... thank you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I think you've saved my life. I did have it before... I just never lived it. I lived yours."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You were overpowering."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I hope very much that I will never be the same."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-6/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And I'll ask you to go wait on the desk now. I'm going to go make my entrance and see what I learn. Come back, come back soon and I'll tell you about it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-6/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll do that. See you soon."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-6/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We'll see. I will if I can."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/edinburgh/0/g-6/c-16/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Surely I have the time."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/4
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "This one is such a jumble. There's the way I always tell it, and then there's the way it actually happened."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And I don't think I'm lying, because how could I possibly do that... lying requires a lot of creativity and mental discipline."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And until recently, I didn't even know that I possessed qualities, let alone qualities like that!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Come to think of it, I might admire liars. What is a good liar but a good story teller? A good spinner of yarns?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But that is what you're asking me to do. Oh god, am I a liar? Am I a liar by definition? Honesty is just perspective! Everyone's a liar! THERE IS NO TRUTH!!!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Diana, calm down. It's ok."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. This is going great."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I... oh boy... I feel like I spaced out for a minute there... spaced, space and time, timed out..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What were we talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jeez, I don't know. I'm gonna go, I think."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Skiing into a tree."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Sure. Yeah, I- I get that. Go-go like a Bangle, get it?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ha... right... I guess it's no wonder I got jumbled. Skiing into a tree will do that to ya."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-0/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you didn't ski into a tree, remember? I did."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-0/c-3/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... let's chalk it up to that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You skiied into a tree and I... just heard about it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Where was I? Was I with you? Riding shotgun? Bonnie and Composition Book?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You were at my grandmother's house, in my room."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love to see your humor coming out."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm in the neighborhood of funny."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I wasn't there. I know I wasn't there. What the hell would I do on skis. I don't know how to ski, I'VE never been skiing and in all your writing you never write HOW to do things."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Do you notice that? You write THAT you did them, or how it WENT or what you enjoyed or hated but never HOW the actual action is performed."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Which... I guess that makes sense. How could you have known that your diary would one day be very curious about the mechanics of, say, scrambling an egg."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Or making a mocktail. Now that I have a fully-fledged mind of my own, I might want to make a virgin Dark And Stormy and read The Old Can and The Sea."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-2/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Diana. Skiing."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-2/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Focusing is a challenge for you, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Skiing. Double 'i's... Odd choice of vowel."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh sigh. Sigh and shake it off, shake it up, do a little dance, make a little love..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-2/c-7/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Get down to business, I know I know, ok."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I remember a lot of bumps. Ooh, there was a bump when I hit that first mogul."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "When YOU hit that first mogul. Then there was a big bump when you landed on the other side of the catwalk."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Then the bump of the tree, obvious-LY."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And then all the bumps when they came and got you and loaded you onto the stretcher head first (who the HELL does it head first)."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And took you down the mogul run bumpbumpbumpityBANG all the way to where the stitches lady was."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Why do I remember so many bumps? You didn't write about bumps. At least not that much. Why is that MY version of this story?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-3/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh my god. I know why."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-3/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha! You're gonna love this."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Spill, milkshake mary!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-4/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My comforter, in my room at my grandma's house... was bumpy."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-4/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My memory is overlapping with YOUR experience!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I was on the bed, in your room, at your grandmother's house, where you left me to go skiing that day."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Are you telling me that you had a bumpy comforter."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Are you telling me that I REMEMBER spending the day on a bumpy comforter and I've colored the story you told me that night with an experience that I already had,"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-5/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "that I already had and REMEMBERED, and I've created my own story of that day??"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-5/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-5/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You got it!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I did it. Oh my god I remember the comforter! It was pink, like shell beige pink with these big green and brown leaves and flowers on it and it was bumpy!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It was practically hilly, that damn thing, a tiny mountaineer would've gotten so lost and tired trying to traverse that!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-6/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha. Tiny mountaineer. Great image."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-6/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's it! Super scratchy, too. Very weird blanket."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I... did you like hearing that? Did you like hearing my memory of that day?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, sure. Not better than french fries, but sure."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just want to read more!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-16/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Then I have an idea. Or... maybe not an idea but a thought. An inkling. Ha! I guess if I ever had children they'd be inklings, right? How cute! Can a journal have kids? Yes! Torn out pages would be my children."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-16/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh god, my children are produced by ripping them out of me. That's graphic. And violent. Maybe I'm better off adopting a fish."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-16/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "ANYWAY. Give me a minute, ok? Ok. Come back in a minute? I think I'm onto something here..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-16/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Back to the lab!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-16/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have fun, Diana."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-16/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I tear out another?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-16/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Said the hammer to the ladle."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Very few things are better than french fries."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "At least according to you. I've never had a french fry, so I'm not really sure."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "My god. I've never had a french fry. That... seems like a tragedy. Am I right? Is it? Could I even rectify that? I can't really go anywhere... could you bring me a french fry?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... I don't think I can..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yeah. I might have one in the Up-n-Down bag from the other night."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's ok. That's not what's most important right now, anyway."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Listen... you have to go."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Not in a bad way, not like before when I yelled and tossed you through the saloon door, so to speak, but... I'm having an idea. And it needs a minute. Like mead has to ferment in the dark sorta thing?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/31/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I guess I could be compared to alcohol. Why not? Gimme a minute... come back in a little while!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Excellent!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Bring it with when you come back, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh, I forgot to tell you, go away."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/31/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm having an idea and I need to work it out."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/31/c-1/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "All good. Puttin' on the glasses and settin' up the typewriter."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-17/31/c-1/47
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Get out. Bring me french fries."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/treeski/0/g-7/c-18/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Let us inspect what is left."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/4
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I thought I smelled a jasmine blossom."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, you might've."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't have a great sense of smell... but maybe we can try again?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Mmm. I have a memory of you making soup. You must've tried it ten times, adding spices and smelling it and chopping up this and that and some more of the squash before it tasted right."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Maybe we needed cayenne."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's... that's my memory. Not yours."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What's the difference."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/16/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Exactly. I think I can help you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/16/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're YOU, not me. And I can prove it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/17/1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're giving me an idea."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/17/1/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Really. You usually have wonderful ideas. I have all of them in here."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/17/1/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's like the scene from that movie with the old woman who carries all her possessions on her back, just in case, somewhere someday she needs that antique garlic press."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/17/1/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Or the pretty rock third-grade Maddie gave you. I have them all."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/17/1/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Or is this a new idea? New ideas. Our greatest good, maybe."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/17/1/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's new. Big time."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fourth_encounter_part3_spring/0/g-0/17/1/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This idea is special. It's about you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You're back! I'm so glad to see you!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I had so many thoughts while you were gone,"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/22
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I thought about mountains and how amazing it must be to get all the way to the top of one and then look down and realize..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/30
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "...that YOU got YOU to that whole different perspective and then I thought about deserts and desserts and man did THAT make me want chocolate cake"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/38
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "because I've had some chocolate cake before when you accidentally smeared it on that one page where you were writing about dogs? Wow. Chocolate is great."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nice to see you, too!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aaaand you're still off your rocker."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So tell me about your idea!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So, are you ready for my idea? Cuz it's about to come out swinging! Swinging a big ol' baseball bat, bucko!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You and me both, apparently."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bring it on!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Off my rocker? What am I, a porch-swing?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And excuse ME very much but if you think I'M off my rocker maybe you should look in the mirror..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Because until very recently, o Beacon of Balance, I was always, only, to the exclusion of all else a reflection of your stable-as-a-teeter-totter self!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, chill out, I was joking!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah fair point."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wasn't sure I wanted to talk to you again. Lesson learned. I'm out."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "OH! Joking! Love that. I get that now, you know. Turns out when I realized I'd been my own self this whole time, that there are some things that really make me laugh."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "For some reason when I was just you, or like, a pale, shadowy, blurred out reflection of the memories that you shared with me, I didn't laugh."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I couldn't even remember good things, it was all bad. Sad. Trauma. Darkness. There's so much light in the world that I couldn't see before!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So? What's this big idea I came back for?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So yeah. Let's just take a second and reflect before we haul off and cast judgment."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Before we throw shade."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Before we act all hard and high 'n mighty 'n stuff."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "All that being said, sure. We're both twisted. But... I'm ok with it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm okay with twisted."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-1/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We'll see..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-1/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "We both will."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/31/c-1/39/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh! We've gone down such a wandering path I almost forgot about my idea!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/idea/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's pretty simple."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/idea/0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's pretty wonderful, really, especially given that I never had choices before and now I do, I've never had a friend before and now I might..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/idea/0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Instead of your diary, just a thing where your secrets go, just a book that can't really share in anything with you, I'd like to be your friend."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/idea/0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "A friend like I know I've never had before."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/idea/0/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "We can SHARE experiences, one to the other. Everything is allowed, like always, everything is safe, like always. But for both of us. Both ways."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/idea/0/40
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Then we both win. And we win more... so much more than we did before, when it was just ink on paper."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/idea/0/48
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It's more like... a heartbeat. One thud is you, the other is me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/idea/0/56
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/idea/0/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love this. I've always considered you... but now I consider you Friend."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/idea/0/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know... not really looking to talk to anyone. Sometimes I just need to unload and forget."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/idea/0/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a good beginning. But... being honest, I was looking for something even more... intimate."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You are? More intimate than the most intimate friend that ever existed?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look. I'll just say it. You're very sexy."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Sexy. Sex-ee. SexE, the new intimate activity robot from Somy."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's not what you mean, is it. I've run away into the words again, haven't I."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I've... I've just never thought of myself that way. I mean, I'm a book. Y'know?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're a lot more than a book now, Diana."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know. It's ok. I'm not trying to freak you out."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I am?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I am. Huh. I wonder what I would be like in a sexy situation. I wonder if I'd talk too much."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Talking can be a real gift in those contexts."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why don't we try and find out?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Talking. Story telling. Setting the scene and the stage... maybe talk that's not clean. Not PG. Hm."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's something you don't give me very much of, you know."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I wonder if you've been shy. I wonder if there are things you've always wanted to do... or say..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "...maybe we are each others' most intimate friends, after all."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looks like we're going to write some great new stuff together."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hold onto your ink, you Saucy Serial."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "What a delicious surprise."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "No sooner do I find out I'm distinct and marvelous in my own right, but I discover I'm a hell of a risk taker, too."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Lead on, you hot Creative."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Write me something steamy."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "No! No, of course. I'm not freaked out."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ok, I am a little. Just a little, though. Like if the freaked were a squeak it would be mouse-sized, not elephant-when-he-sees-a-mouse sized. Do elephants really not like mice?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That seems more like a Disney trope than an actual zoological fact."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-3/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're really nervous, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-3/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't actually know. Would you rather just talk about mice?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-3/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Well... it's just all new. Maybe if we can go slow? And occasionally take breaks to talk about things like ice cream, and rowboats,"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-3/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "and the total dinosaur, throwback, how-the-hell-did-they-survive-the-meteor nature of lizards?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-3/31/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Diana, we can take forever. I'm in no rush."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-3/31/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lizards are bizarre. And slow is even more fun."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-3/31/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Well then... how about you run a finger down my spine?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_love/0/g-0/c-3/31/g-0/16/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I feel like that would be a pretty perfect first move."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Friend. YES!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/11
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh fireworks and fizzy drinks and all the good things about every holiday you've ever heard of!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/19
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I did hear about one once that was mostly human sacrifice so that one... no. But the other ones, all of them!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/27
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Like the pictures of people smiling and covered in colors? Laughing with their arms around each other? Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/35
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It is such a relief to know that I can keep your secrets now!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/43
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "To know that I have stories and experiences that are mine, that I have someone to share them with, that we can go through the world together and be amazed or surprised or just present if we want to?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know that I'll take you everywhere I go!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm relieved, too. I feel safer knowing that you are happy!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Except the bathroom."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "There are some things I don't need to know."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Actually? On second thought? Take me to the bathroom!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I want to know everything because I can protect and treasure everything and frankly I've never understood automatic soap dispensers."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You want to go to the bathroom with me?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know! They are so weird to me, too!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Yeah! When you have to, of course. Don't go off and drink a liter of water or anything."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Until then, though... whatever happens is ok. Whatever you want to do or tell me... I'm in. Friend."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh happy sigh."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I mean, I guess they're great when they work but what about when they break! Are they battery operated?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Are they plugged into the wall? What if the plug gets wet? How do you get the soap out if it won't... dispense?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm just saying, if I don't wash my hands, it's kinda not really my fault, in that circumstance."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/39/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So, bathroom."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/39/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, we'll check it out, then!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Excellent. I'm ready."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ready for the next adventure, Friend!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Not that I ever would've betrayed you on purpose."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It just would've happened. And it would've destroyed me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But now I can choose."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And I choose to be myself, and it turns out that I am pretty great. A great confidante, and friend. Just like you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I hope you write about everything that's happened between us... I won't forget... but I'd love to have it written down somewhere so I can read it and remember all over again. Friend."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You are back, O Mighty One."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Is that ok? Is that right?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It seems a little silly to call you Mighty because I know so many things about you now that would tell me you're pretty normal and flawed but gods are always described as mighty."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "All the research I've been doing says Mighty is righty-o."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Mighty's good."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hahahahaha. Oh. You're... you're very smart."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well if you just want to hang out and be friends... I can do that."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Mighty it is!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And you are officially the head of a great pantheon now."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Great as in awesome, not necessarily great as in big because, to be truthful, I don't know that many other people or things or places so I don't have a LOT of stuff in my life to deify. Yet."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Maybe that will come with exposure to the real world. Maybe."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Wanna meet 'em...? Or, sorry..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/47
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Do you desire, O Mighty One, to become acquainted with the residents of your pantheon?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I sure do, let's get it going!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Know what... I'm sorry, I'm not god. I got carried away..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/55/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "...what?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/55/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not god. I'm just me. Just a person."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/55/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... please don't be mad."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/55/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh. Well..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/55/c-1/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ok, truthfully? During my research I did figure out on my own that you weren't God in the classical sense."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/55/c-1/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Gods don't have to floss their teeth, and they don't eat quite as much take out as you do, or wear mismatched socks."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/55/c-1/15/g-0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But I figured that, if this was a way for us to play together, to get to know each other and have fun and just... be, then it was worth it."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/55/c-1/15/g-0/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I sort of thought that maybe \"god\" or \"mighty one\"... well, it's akin to a nickname, of sorts."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/c-0/55/c-1/15/g-0/40
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Like Bob. My God, Bob."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Excellent! Friends it is!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Do you still want to meet your pantheon, though? I'm quite proud of my first ever solo creative project."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I'm ok. You're enough for me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/g-0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I'd love that!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/g-0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh. You can just call me god. Normal ol' god."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "With gratitude, O Mighty One."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Tee hee."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "This friends thing is going to be fun."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You want me to call you Normal Ol' God?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Seems a bit undignified but as you wish! According to my research, it is not the purview of mortals to pass judgment on a deity."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_friendship_pantheon/0/g-0/c-5/23
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ahem. Normal Ol' God, I present to you, your pantheon!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/21
msgctxt "Hanks"
msgid "WHAT UP WE'RE THE PANTHEON!!!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/47
msgctxt "Hank 1"
msgid "Diana let us in to do a hang together!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/55
msgctxt "Hank 4"
msgid "She's so awesome!!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/63
msgctxt "Hank 3"
msgid "I always thought she was a book or something."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/71
msgctxt "Hank 3"
msgid "But she's a book whose story keeps getting told!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/79
msgctxt "Hank 2"
msgid "Like a wingsuit dive that never ends!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/87
msgctxt "Hanks"
msgid "WOAHH!!!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/110
msgctxt "Hanks"
msgid "THE STORY OF OUR TIMES IS AN INTERTWINING AND NEVERENDING TAPESTRY!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/133
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I love these dorks."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/141
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Our intimacy will NEVER fade. I've heard the phrase ride-or-die out there in the world that I can be part of now... that's what we are."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/149
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But think how much cooler all of our sharing could be if my life got even bigger! And I didn't think that was possible."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/157
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Until just a little while ago, I didn't even know that I was... ME! And now I could be me AND."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/165
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And you're giving that to me. What more could I possibly ask for from a friend?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/173/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok ok, I'm gonna blush."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/174/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so happy for you, Diana!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "We ride, Hanks!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/gods/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Hanks"
msgid "SHA! RIDE OR DIE!!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_hate/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Ah. No, I... I see."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_hate/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I understand. Sometimes the windows just won't open. For whatever reason they're glued closed, or cruelest of all, they were only designed to be decorative."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_hate/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You can see the world but never get to it. Never touch it. Never be touched."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_hate/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And the trees drop all their leaves and the grass hardens and frosts over and you're just there... there..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_hate/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Someone has spilled their tea but it will dry."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_ending_hate/40
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "It will dry into the plasticine panelling and leave a stain that mocks an eye for beauty."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_love/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh. Hi."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_love/0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I can't tell you... I can't really say how I've been dreaming about seeing you again."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_love/0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I dream now. Did you know? If I could write them the way you write them, I'd burn myself up page by page..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_love/0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I guess what I mean is, it's good to see you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_love/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's good to see you, my love."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_love/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Would you like to really see me? Because I'd like to really see you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_love/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Anything on your mind?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_love/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your time spent with Diana is as lovely as she is - you tell her your thoughts, and she shares with you her dreams."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh you're back. I have so much to tell you; I bet you have so much to tell me! Adventures? New friends? This is the place to share, divulge, unburden and reflect!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "The fact that we both get to do it is just... it's the best."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'm still me. You may have imagined that identity fades in and out like a camera seeking focus. But really it changes colors. The chameleon learns and adjusts but it's still a lizard in the end."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I think also I might be obsessed with lizards."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/32/b/4
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "Come, let us talk of toucans!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/32/b/12
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Oh wow!!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/32/b/20
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Be there in a minute!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/35
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Anyway. Welcome! It's always so good to see you."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well then I shall come again soon. See ya, friend."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell Barry I said 'caw'!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if I could offer you real skin, my chameleon?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Any stories for me?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your time spent with Diana always brings you joy."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_friendship/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Will do, friend."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_hate/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Did they send you away?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_hate/0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I hear schoolmistresses are cruel when their backs are up."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_hate/0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "How a back could be up or down still bemuses me. Me. I. Am I the bemused or am I the source of all confusion."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_hate/0/24
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'll never know. I knew someone once who might have told me..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_hate/0/32
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But they sailed off and the sun swallowed them up. A willing Icarus to destruction."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_hate/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still as crazy as ever, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_hate/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Diana, I've been needlessly cruel to you. (USE POISE CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_hate/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You should go. You have already. You just don't know it yet."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_hate/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "To me? To me?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_hate/0/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. I... don't know what to say."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_hate/0/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Simply write it in my pages and all will be forgiven."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_return_hate/0/c-1/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's what fiends are for."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/frs_love/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "You know, I was just thinking about how interesting you'd look if you had a Fantastic Red Shirt."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/frs_love/0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And then <i>Bam!</i> There you are!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/frs_love/0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I was totally right...!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/frs_love/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks, Diana. That means a lot."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/frs_love/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I love that!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/frs_friend/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "So I went swimming once and I met this <i>big eel</i>."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/frs_friend/0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "And I thought he was cool..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/frs_friend/0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But not anywhere near as cool as you in that Fantastic Red Shirt!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/frs_friend/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/frs_friend/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Wow! Damn...!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I... yes. Enthusiastically and with no context. Yes."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "But as I understand it, this isn't entirely up to me."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_join/0/16
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Do you have what you need?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_join/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_join/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "That's all right. Getting organized can be a lengthy process."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Seeing you again makes me hope!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_return/0/8
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Am I right to hope?"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, you are."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_return/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's nothing wrong with hope. But patience is a better call at this moment."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I'll be here, dreaming about... everything."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Starting with your own diary seems very brave. I would be so scared of someone peeking!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Diana - bring your magic to the world!"
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely your diary, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "Whoa... I... I have skin."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Diana runs her fingers over her own body, understanding slowly that for the first time in her existence, she IS."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I have an ending. Which must mean I have a beginning. And then between those two points, if they even are points, they may be spectra of their own, there must be a middle."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Diana's hands come to rest on her own very real belly."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She looks up at you with quivering silver tears balanced in her eyes."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/46
msgctxt "Diana"
msgid "I have a middle."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so proud of you, Diana."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And what a beautiful middle it is."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Diana smiles and blushes. She moves towards you and leans into your shoulder..."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Not in your wildest dreams could you have anticipated the firestorm of sensation that erupts within you. From this simple and trusting graze on your shoulder, a rippling electricity rolls through your skin."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your bones begin to shake, and pyrotechnics flash behind your eyes. Every muscle in your body goes taut, then limp, then taut again, and your mind is a swirling ocean of sound and color. Bells, happy laughter, the smell of baking bread, deep oranges and pinks, wind through pine trees."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "This is enough, you decide. This is more than enough."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_realized/0/c-1/42
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You slip your hand into hers and breathe."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Diana's gratitude at finally having a Self to understand was so deep, that she wanted to help other people discover themselves in the same way. She became a therapist."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For a while, her practice was booming. For as you can attest, there has never been a better listener and keeper of secrets than Diana."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But as time went by, she began to notice the same creeping dissolution, that numb panic that had defined so many of her years in the house. She was filling her new self to the brim with \"other,\" and the fragile Her was being crushed beneath the accumulated mass."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Finally, she had had enough. Walking back to her apartment from the office, she found herself standing befuddled in the middle of a crowded intersection."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "All the lights were broken. The pedestrian signal flashed \"go/stop/stopstop/go.\" The cars from all sides were honking, the driver of a yellow taxi to her right waving his arms, the driver of a great black SUV in front of her laying on the horn in dark sunglasses."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Diana stood disassociated in the midst of this chaos."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "From deep within her, a slow knowledge welled up; a simple and powerful \"No.\" She reached out with her right arm, and swivelled her eyes to focus on the driver of the yellow taxi at the end of her fingers. She flipped her palm upward to face him; STOP."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/59
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And he stopped."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/67
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She reached out with her left arm and cleanly motioned for the great black SUV to move forward, slowly, there."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/75
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And he moved. And the car behind him moved. And the car behind that one followed."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/83
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When 11 cars had gone through, Diana flipped her palm, and the cars stopped on a dime, as if by magic. She rotated her eyes back to the yellow taxi and motioned to him; your turn."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/91
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He stared at her, transfixed. But with only a slight hesitation, he began to move. And the car after him. And the van after that. Once he was through the intersection, the cabbie leaned out of his window and smiled."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/99
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A bystander did eventually call the police, and the lights in the intersection were repaired that night. But Diana had found her happy place. She has been the star of the Metro Traffic Bureau ever since."
msgstr ""

#: diana_diary/diana_love_join/107
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "On her days off, she sometimes comes back to visit."
msgstr ""
